<decision #upgrade-depa-data-graph-package-baseline.scope {
  status = "accepted"
  priority = "P0"
}
(
  <question ?>Should package resolution and source migration be implemented in the same track？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>No.</?>
    <decision-text ?>This track upgrades direct manifests and bun.lock, then updates only the boundary guard. Source-level unified API migration stays in the successor tracks.</?>
    <rationale ?>The upstream release is breaking and the mission needs an observable dependency baseline before distinct behavior owners change their graph code.</?>
    <evidence ?>The containing mission G1 baseline reports and target migration contract.</?>
  )>
)>
